I am now in my new home.
The home is beautiful.
In my hand is the big suitcase.
I put the big suitcase down on the floor.
The suitcase is placed near the door.
Asha is near me.
My small bag is in her hand.
Asha looks around the room.
She places the small bag on the floor.
The small bag is placed near the suitcase.
Now the bags are on the floor.
Asha smiles.
She speaks to me.
"Maya, your bags are here."
"There is no hurry here."
"You have time," Asha says.
I nod.
"Thank you, Asha," I say.
I look at the bags on the floor.
Now I am in my new home.
